# Same-erasure raw bridge restores the invariant generic view without a narrower
# runtime check. Original Signature and six-variant behavior are pinned by the
# type-variable contract and mutation tests. Identity self() remains uncast.
+/return \(ThisReparamSeed<N1>\) \(ThisReparamSeed\) \(this\)/
+/ThisReparamSeed<N> self\(\) \{\s*return this;/
